    { "key": "story.title", "section": "Story", "what": "Story heading", "copy": "Two of a kind, and no kind at all" },
    { "key": "story.quote", "section": "Story", "what": "One line in your own words (pull quote)", "copy": "⟨One line in your own words⟩" },
    { "key": "story.body", "section": "Story", "what": "How you met", "copy": "They met in college and became best friends, the kind who trade records, sketchbooks, and unsolicited opinions. Somewhere between the music and the art, the thing they shared most turned out to be a refusal to be anyone but themselves. Their first date fell on or around Halloween, which explains a great deal. Now, ⟨X⟩ years later, they would like to make it official. In black and white, naturally." },
